{"strongs": "H1410", "word": "גָּד", "translit": "gad", "root": "גדוד", "morph": "N:N-M-P", "pos": "proper name, masculine", "gloss": "fortunatus", "definition": "III. גָּד 71 proper name, masculine ( fortunatus ? perhaps derived from foregoing divine name Siegf JPTh 1875, 364 Sta Geschichte.i.148 ; but see also Bae Rel 159f. ) — שָגּד Gen 35:26 +, as well as גָּד֑ Gen 30:11 +; — 1. son of Jacob and Zilpah; \\ \\ a. strictly as personal name Gen 30:11 ; Gen 35:26 ; Gen 46:16 ; Exod 1:4 compare Gen 49:19 ; 1Chr 2:2 . \\ \\ b. as name of tribe Num 1:14 ; Deut 27:13 ; Deut 33:20 (twice in verse); Josh 18:7 ; Ezek 48:27 ; Ezek 48:28 compare אֶרֶץ גָּד 1Sam 13:7 see also Jer 49:1 , שַׁעַד גָּד Ezek 48:34 , on הַנַּחַל הַגָּד 2Sam 24:5 compare We Dr ; explicitly מַטֵּה גָּד Num 1:25 ; Num 2:14 ; Num 13:15 ; Josh 13:24 ; Josh 20:8 ; Josh 21:7 ; Josh 21:36 ; 1Chr 6:48 ; 1Chr 6:65 once, צְבָא מַטֵּה בְנֵיגָֿד Num 10:20 בְּנֵי גָד ( MI 10 אש גד ) Num 1:24 + 12 t. Numbers; Josh 4:12 + 14 t. Joshua; 1Chr 5:11 ; 1Chr 12:14 . 2. a prophet in David's time, called נָבִיא 1Sam 22:5 , but הַנָּבִיא חֹזֶה דָוִד 2Sam 24:11 & חֹזֵה דָוִיד || 1Chr 21:9 , הַחֹזֶה 1Chr 29:29 & חֹזֵההַֿמֶּלֶךְ 2Chr 29:25 .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB1480')\">BDB1480</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H1410')\">H1410</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB1479')\">BDB1479</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB1481')\">BDB1481</entry></div><p> III. <bdbheb>גָּד</bdbheb><sub>71</sub> <b>proper name, masculine</b> (<highlight>fortunatus</highlight>? perhaps derived from foregoing divine name <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Siegf')\">Siegf<sup>JPTh 1875, 364</sup></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sta')\">Sta<sup>Geschichte.i.148</sup></lookup>; but see also <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Bae')\">Bae<sup>Rel 159f.</sup></lookup>) — <bdbheb>שָגּד</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 35:26\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"35\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"35\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(1,35,26)\">Gen 35:26</ref> +, as well as <bdbheb>גָּד֑</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 30:11\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(1,30,11)\">Gen 30:11</ref> +; — <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> son of Jacob and Zilpah; <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>a.</b> strictly as personal name <ref ref=\"Gen 30:11\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(1,30,11)\">Gen 30:11</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 35:26\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"35\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"35\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(1,35,26)\">Gen 35:26</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 46:16\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"46\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"46\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(1,46,16)\">Gen 46:16</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 1:4\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(2,1,4)\">Exod 1:4</ref> compare <ref ref=\"Gen 49:19\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"49\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"49\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(1,49,19)\">Gen 49:19</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Chr 2:2\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(13,2,2)\">1Chr 2:2</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> as name of tribe <ref ref=\"Num 1:14\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(4,1,14)\">Num 1:14</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 27:13\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"27\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"27\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(5,27,13)\">Deut 27:13</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 33:20\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"33\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"33\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(5,33,20)\">Deut 33:20</ref> (twice in verse); <ref ref=\"Josh 18:7\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(6,18,7)\">Josh 18:7</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 48:27\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"48\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"48\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(26,48,27)\">Ezek 48:27</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 48:28\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"48\" vBegin=\"28\" cEnd=\"48\" vEnd=\"28\" onclick=\"bcv(26,48,28)\">Ezek 48:28</ref> compare <bdbheb>אֶרֶץ גָּד</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Sam 13:7\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(9,13,7)\">1S